# Merge rules (project-framework PF-0022, PF-0029). Two sessions can append to the same file at once.
# union keeps both sides' new lines instead of a conflict. Since v0.2 card IDs are Asia/Taipei times,
# two sessions rarely make the same ID, so INDEX.md merges with union too. After a merge, check the topic table for doubled rows.
zettelkasten/log/*.md merge=union
zettelkasten/INDEX.md merge=union
